# These requirements are installed into the recipe image when you publish the
# package. `ellf publish code` reads them from the package metadata and
# installs them into the recipe image on your cluster.
#
# Only list what the base recipes image doesn't include. Every package listed
# here is installed again, even if the image already includes it.
# `ellf-recipes-sdk` is in requirements-dev.in instead, because listing it
# here would also install spaCy, boto3, google-cloud and psycopg2.
#
# The notebooks also use pandas and altair, which the base image already
# includes. Listing them here could replace the versions the rest of the image
# depends on.
marimo >= 0.24.0, < 0.25.0
